# PREDICTIONS (inferred), not results. Written 2026-11-28 before any run.
# Calibrates: section 7 row "zpos and intersection" (the expected liftoff-only case).
# NV12 fits only the zpos-2 plane (12); AR24 fits planes 10 and 11. The lower layer (NV12)
# must therefore sit on a higher plane than the upper layer (AR24).
# libliftoff keeps relative zpos only between intersecting layers; core's Z_ORDER covers every placed layer.
disjoint-inverted   structural=liftoff-only full=liftoff-only
overlap-inverted    structural=both-reject  full=both-reject
disjoint-ordered    structural=both-accept  full=both-accept   # control
